# Champion of the Clachan (CR 607.2q): the Kithkin exiled as the cost is linked to the permanent that spell became, so each of two Champions returns only its own.
# Bot1 casts one beholding Figure of Destiny from its hand on turn 1 and the second beholding Knight of Meadowgrain on turn 3. When Bot2's Swords to Plowshares
# exiles the first Champion on turn 4, the Figure returns to its owner's hand and the Knight stays exiled for the second.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Figure of Destiny
Knight of Meadowgrain
Champion of the Clachan
Champion of the Clachan
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x18

